        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the premature discarding of the `savedFilteringAndGrouping` data before it could be utilized by the asynchronous global optimization process. This led to a situation where the necessary data was not available when the global optimization was executed, resulting in incorrect behavior or failure of the optimization.

        Commit message:
        fix bug where saved SpimDataFilteringAndGrouping was
 discarded before it could be used by the asynchronous global optimization
 (introduced in acef72c39cbf097729924faebb8b92c825642e33)  

